e journey, but does not establish the cabin on every leg; no flight schedule or connection details are provided.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline — Cathay Pacific, January 1\",\"v\":\"The selected cash comparison is a one-stop SFO–HKG–BKK itinerary, departing January 1 at 10:55 p.m. local time and arriving January 4 at 10:35 a.m. Bangkok time. Its source quote is USD 640.00, with quote scope unknown; it is not established as a per-person or party total. This gives a dated, scheduled cash option to compare, but it is not an award itinerary.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Shared limits: the selected award results are incomplete leads, not confirmed itineraries, and their quoted taxes have unknown scope. Verify the full routing, cabin by leg, seat support, current availability, and applicable charges with the relevant program before booking. The search coverage was partial, so these selected results do not establish that no complete award options exist.\"}]}"
